00:03:18.204 --> 00:03:19.765
- I think this is a really important topic

00:03:19.765 --> 00:03:20.829
because as entrepreneurs,

00:03:20.829 --> 00:03:21.820
we are going to get faced

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:22.735
