00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.433
as we are trying to build something new,

00:03:24.433 --> 00:03:25.568
put it out into the market.

00:03:25.568 --> 00:03:26.592
Try to get some feedback.

00:03:26.592 --> 00:03:27.643
Try to build something.

00:03:27.643 --> 00:03:28.874
We're doing something that's

00:03:28.874 --> 00:03:29.817
never been done before.

00:03:29.817 --> 00:03:30.888
Ideally as entrepreneurs

00:03:30.888 --> 00:03:32.628
we like creating new stuff.

00:03:32.628 --> 00:03:33.633
And when you're doing that

00:03:33.633 --> 00:03:34.789
you're going to make a lot of mistakes.

00:03:34.789 --> 00:03:36.638
And people don't always like new.

00:03:36.638 --> 00:03:37.818
And they are going to bash you for it.

00:03:37.818 --> 00:03:39.535
There's two things I want to talk about.

00:03:39.535 --> 00:03:40.368
The first is,

00:03:40.368 --> 00:03:41.420
you need to understand

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:42.331
that to have success

00:03:42.331 --> 00:03:43.414
as an entrepreneur,

00:03:43.414 --> 00:03:44.527
you need to combine

00:03:44.527 --> 00:03:46.278
what you love doing,

00:03:46.278 --> 00:03:48.496
with what adds value to other people.

00:03:48.496 --> 00:03:49.434
This is the mix.

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:50.841
You need both elements.

00:03:50.841 --> 00:03:52.082
Something that you love doing

00:03:52.082 --> 00:03:53.487
and you can pour your heart,

00:03:53.487 --> 00:03:54.320
your energy,

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.153
your spirit.

00:03:55.153 --> 00:03:55.986
Everything you got.

00:03:55.986 --> 00:03:57.064
Your waking moments,

00:03:57.064 --> 00:03:57.897
hours,

00:03:57.897 --> 00:03:58.730
days,

00:03:58.730 --> 00:03:59.563
into making this thing

00:03:59.563 --> 00:04:00.396
the best it can be

00:04:00.396 --> 00:04:02.213
because you love it so much.

00:04:02.213 --> 00:04:03.281
Combined with

00:04:03.281 --> 00:04:05.114
what the market wants.

00:04:05.997 --> 00:04:07.610
What do your audience want?

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:09.456
What do customers want to pay for.

00:04:09.456 --> 00:04:10.289
You need both to have

00:04:10.289 --> 00:04:11.824
success in business.

00:04:11.824 --> 00:04:13.932
Because if you love doing something.

00:04:13.932 --> 00:04:14.765
You love it,

00:04:14.765 --> 00:04:15.822
it's your absolute passion,

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:17.783
but it adds zero value to other people.

00:04:17.783 --> 00:04:18.846
Then it's great.

00:04:18.846 --> 00:04:19.886
It's a hobby.

00:04:19.886 --> 00:04:21.223
It's something that you do for yourself,

00:04:21.223 --> 00:04:22.056
that fills your soul.

00:04:22.056 --> 00:04:23.812
Makes you a better human being.

00:04:23.812 --> 00:04:24.683
It's awesome.

00:04:24.683 --> 00:04:26.272
But it's not a business.

00:04:26.272 --> 00:04:27.105
Where,

00:04:27.105 --> 00:04:28.712
if you're only chasing

00:04:28.712 --> 00:04:29.564
the market.

00:04:29.564 --> 00:04:32.210
You're chasing the hottest opportunity.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.043
Then yeah,

00:04:33.043 --> 00:04:33.876
you can make a little bit of money

00:04:33.876 --> 00:04:34.709
in the short term.

00:04:34.709 --> 00:04:35.924
But if you don't love it,

00:04:35.924 --> 00:04:37.345
you're never going to
to be the best at it.

00:04:37.345 --> 00:04:38.749
You're never going to win that game.

00:04:38.749 --> 00:04:40.058
You're never going to
have a lot of success

00:04:40.058 --> 00:04:40.891
in business.

00:04:40.891 --> 00:04:42.423
So you need both.

00:04:42.423 --> 00:04:43.533
The love,

00:04:43.533 --> 00:04:45.636
and the audience acceptance.

00:04:45.636 --> 00:04:48.014
So, the love has to come from inside.

00:04:48.014 --> 00:04:49.253
The audience acceptance

00:04:49.253 --> 00:04:51.363
comes from feedback.

00:04:51.363 --> 00:04:52.530
Comes from criticism.

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:54.189
Comes from talking to customers

00:04:54.189 --> 00:04:55.551
and understanding

00:04:55.551 --> 00:04:56.623
what to they want?

00:04:56.623 --> 00:04:57.841
How can you help them.

00:04:57.841 --> 00:04:59.150
When I look at the videos I make

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.160
on this channel,

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.554
most of the content

