For do you want for the next

00:05:07.069 --> 00:05:07.902
believe life series.

00:05:07.902 --> 00:05:08.735
Right.

00:05:08.735 --> 00:05:09.568
All of these things

00:05:09.568 --> 00:05:10.401
come from you guys

00:05:10.401 --> 00:05:11.268
giving me suggestions,

00:05:11.268 --> 00:05:12.101
and saying

00:05:12.101 --> 00:05:12.934
hey, this video can be better.

