00:05:21.796 --> 00:05:23.381
do I want to do that or not.

00:05:23.381 --> 00:05:24.463
Do I love it.

00:05:24.463 --> 00:05:25.296
Right.

00:05:25.296 --> 00:05:26.277
Make a top ten on this person.

00:05:26.277 --> 00:05:28.878
Make a series on this idea.

00:05:28.878 --> 00:05:29.711
You know.

00:05:29.711 --> 00:05:30.560
If I'm not connected to it,

