This is where we are playing our game.

00:05:33.864 --> 00:05:34.874
We're dancing right,

00:05:34.874 --> 00:05:36.888
you have two people in a dance.

00:05:36.888 --> 00:05:37.898
And that's where you have to

00:05:37.898 --> 00:05:39.954
