00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:47.666
to get that harmony happening.

00:05:47.666 --> 00:05:48.499
The other thing

00:05:48.499 --> 00:05:50.047
that I want to talk about quickly,

00:05:50.047 --> 00:05:51.176
is one of my favorite quotes,

00:05:51.176 --> 00:05:52.546
and it's from Quincy Jones.

00:05:52.546 --> 00:05:54.608
And we did an Entspresso on.

00:05:54.608 --> 00:05:56.718
And a top ten on it I think.

00:05:56.718 --> 00:05:57.551
Where he said,

00:05:57.551 --> 00:05:59.779
'Not one ounce of my self respect,

00:05:59.779 --> 00:06:02.466
comes from your opinion of me.'

00:06:02.466 --> 00:06:04.356
And I think this is so important.

00:06:04.356 --> 00:06:06.874
Especially for the early
stages of an entrepreneur.

00:06:06.874 --> 00:06:08.341
Because as you're building your thing up

00:06:08.341 --> 00:06:10.427
you may have this big idea.

00:06:10.427 --> 00:06:11.260
That you maybe you don't

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.854
even really believe in yet either.

00:06:12.854 --> 00:06:13.687
Right.

00:06:13.687 --> 00:06:14.540
You want to be here,

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.043
but you're still playing down here.

00:06:16.043 --> 00:06:17.080
And you're afraid.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.870
And you haven't even convinced yourself

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.663
that you're ready to go there.

00:06:20.663 --> 00:06:22.602
Let alone telling other people about it.

00:06:22.602 --> 00:06:23.971
And when you tell other
people about your idea,

00:06:23.971 --> 00:06:25.736
they may laugh at you,

00:06:25.736 --> 00:06:26.863
they may make fun of you,

00:06:26.863 --> 00:06:27.960
they may tell you all the reasons why

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.096
it's not going to work.

00:06:29.096 --> 00:06:29.932
And so you are afraid

00:06:29.932 --> 00:06:31.421
to go and tell other people about

00:06:31.421 --> 00:06:32.287
what you are trying to do.

00:06:32.287 --> 00:06:33.549
And you need to get help right,

00:06:33.549 --> 00:06:35.006
you need people to poke holes

00:06:35.006 --> 00:06:35.892
into your idea,

00:06:35.892 --> 00:06:37.052
and help you find the path.

00:06:37.052 --> 00:06:39.087
Because you can't do everything yourself.

00:06:39.087 --> 00:06:40.703
And so, understand that,

00:06:40.703 --> 00:06:42.341
you're going to get criticized.

00:06:42.341 --> 00:06:43.683
Some people will be really nice about it,

00:06:43.683 --> 00:06:45.005
and really constructive about it,

00:06:45.005 --> 00:06:47.619
and give you a positive message with it.

00:06:47.619 --> 00:06:48.934
And some people won't.

00:06:48.934 --> 00:06:49.767
Some people just tell you

00:06:49.767 --> 00:06:50.693
that it's crap.

00:06:50.693 --> 00:06:52.058
And they will insult you over it.

00:06:52.058 --> 00:06:53.072
But it doesn't mean that they

00:06:53.072 --> 00:06:54.870
don't necessarily have a point.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.603
And you need to differentiate between

00:06:56.603 --> 00:06:58.285
a personal attack on you

00:06:58.285 --> 00:06:59.739
versus an attack on the idea,

00:06:59.739 --> 00:07:01.162
and how it can be better.

00:07:01.162 --> 00:07:01.995
And if somebody

00:07:01.995 --> 00:07:04.346
