00:07:08.515 --> 00:07:11.605
Not one ounce of my self respect

00:07:11.605 --> 00:07:14.411
comes from your opinion of me.

00:07:14.411 --> 00:07:16.971
You don't like my top ten video.

00:07:16.971 --> 00:07:17.804
Okay.

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:19.215
You know, I wrote a great book.

00:07:19.215 --> 00:07:20.463
I love the book.

