So far all the reviews of the book

00:07:21.882 --> 00:07:23.320
have been pretty good.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:25.719
But if you don't like my book.

00:07:25.719 --> 00:07:26.869
Okay.

00:07:26.869 --> 00:07:28.059
Like, it's not for every single

00:07:28.059 --> 00:07:29.962
human being on this planet.

00:07:29.962 --> 00:07:31.949
And your negative thoughts

00:07:31.949 --> 00:07:32.782
around my book

00:07:32.782 --> 00:07:33.748
is not going to make me feel

00:07:33.748 --> 00:07:35.827
worse about myself.

00:07:35.827 --> 00:07:37.707
Or about the amazing piece of work

00:07:37.707 --> 00:07:39.507
that I created.

00:07:39.507 --> 00:07:40.512
And if you don't like

00:07:40.512 --> 00:07:42.462
