00:07:43.633 --> 00:07:44.626
or my T-shirt.

00:07:44.626 --> 00:07:46.187
Or think I should be in a suit.

00:07:46.187 --> 00:07:47.441
Or anything.

00:07:47.441 --> 00:07:49.043
It doesn't impact me.

00:07:49.043 --> 00:07:50.287
I got to do me.

00:07:50.287 --> 00:07:51.779
I don't care.

00:07:51.779 --> 00:07:53.186
And so learning

00:07:53.186 --> 00:07:54.855
to be able to handle that.

00:07:54.855 --> 00:07:56.111
To be able to take criticism,

00:07:56.111 --> 00:07:58.199
and not let it impact you

00:07:58.199 --> 00:08:00.303
on a personal self worth level.

00:08:00.303 --> 00:08:02.561
And differentiate between,

00:08:02.561 --> 00:08:03.840
this can actually help me,

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:05.113
make something better.

00:08:05.113 --> 00:08:07.091
And this is useless.

00:08:07.091 --> 00:08:08.691
Because you need to get to the point

00:08:08.691 --> 00:08:09.896
where you're combining

00:08:09.896 --> 00:08:11.229
what you love doing.

00:08:11.229 --> 00:08:12.062
Your passion.

00:08:12.062 --> 00:08:13.188
Where you can be the best in the world

00:08:13.188 --> 00:08:14.305
at potentially.

00:08:14.305 --> 00:08:16.057
With what people want

00:08:16.057 --> 00:08:17.691
and you can add value to them.

00:08:17.691 --> 00:08:19.588
Mix these together.

00:08:19.588 --> 00:08:21.627
That's a successful business.

00:08:21.627 --> 00:08:22.818
So the question of the day today is,

00:08:22.818 --> 00:08:23.749
I am curious,

00:08:23.749 --> 00:08:26.063
how do you handle criticism?

00:08:26.063 --> 00:08:27.091
What do you do?

00:08:27.091 --> 00:08:29.121
I'm curious what your thought process is.

00:08:29.121 --> 00:08:30.495
Leave it down in the comments below,

00:08:30.495 --> 00:08:32.041
