♫ Entspresso keep me going

00:08:56.888 --> 00:08:57.863
- Hey guys, so I decided to add

00:08:57.863 --> 00:08:59.771
a couple extra bonus clips

00:08:59.771 --> 00:09:00.604
just for you

00:09:00.604 --> 00:09:01.437
around this topic

00:09:01.437 --> 00:09:03.139
of being able to handle criticism

00:09:03.139 --> 00:09:04.505
that I hope you will enjoy

00:09:04.505 --> 00:09:05.656
as a bonus.

00:09:05.656 --> 00:09:06.617
- There's four things

00:09:06.617 --> 00:09:07.537
when somebody gives you feedback

00:09:07.537 --> 00:09:08.575
or criticism.

00:09:08.575 --> 00:09:09.408
However it is intended,

00:09:09.408 --> 00:09:10.241
whether it is ill

00:09:10.241 --> 00:09:11.074
or positive.

00:09:11.074 --> 00:09:11.907
And so one is,

00:09:11.907 --> 00:09:12.740
not to take it in,

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:13.585
but to catch it.

00:09:13.585 --> 00:09:14.775
I think of it like a catchers mitt.

00:09:14.775 --> 00:09:16.040
If you tell me something,

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.514
and you come across this way.

00:09:17.514 --> 00:09:18.589
I'll grab it.

00:09:18.589 --> 00:09:19.422
And I'm going to look at it,

00:09:19.422 --> 00:09:20.255
and I'll think, okay.

00:09:20.255 --> 00:09:21.088
Is it true?

00:09:21.088 --> 00:09:21.921
If it's true,

00:09:21.921 --> 00:09:23.184
cool I will put it in and learn from it.

00:09:23.184 --> 00:09:24.411
If I think it's not true,

00:09:24.411 --> 00:09:25.244
cool, I will throw it away.

00:09:25.244 --> 00:09:26.077
No harm, no foul,

00:09:26.077 --> 00:09:27.397
I'm not going to dwell on it.

00:09:27.397 --> 00:09:28.230
Right.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.063
And I think everybody needs this

00:09:29.063 --> 00:09:29.896
in this world.

00:09:29.896 --> 00:09:30.729
Because we're all on,

00:09:30.729 --> 00:09:31.726
most of us are on social media,

00:09:31.726 --> 00:09:32.559
and we're al getting like ...

00:09:32.559 --> 00:09:33.392
(host laughs)

00:09:33.392 --> 00:09:34.225
You know, all our thoughts are getting

00:09:34.225 --> 00:09:35.058
picked apart.

00:09:35.058 --> 00:09:35.891
You know, all the time.

00:09:35.891 --> 00:09:37.097
So we really need this more than ever.

00:09:37.097 --> 00:09:38.532
Then the third one is,

00:09:38.532 --> 00:09:40.294
you get it, and it's a maybe.

00:09:40.294 --> 00:09:41.127
Well I'm not sure,

00:09:41.127 --> 00:09:41.960
you said this about me.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:42.793
I'm not sure.

00:09:42.793 --> 00:09:43.626
You know, what do you guys think?

00:09:43.626 --> 00:09:44.459
You know, what do you think?

00:09:44.459 --> 00:09:45.292
I'll ask my friends,

00:09:45.292 --> 00:09:46.125
and I'll ask other people

00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:46.958
and get some feedback,

00:09:46.958 --> 00:09:48.506
and if it's true,

00:09:48.506 --> 00:09:49.339
cool, maybe I'll learn from it.

00:09:49.339 --> 00:09:50.172
If everyone is like

00:09:50.172 --> 00:09:51.005
this is total nonsense,

00:09:51.005 --> 00:09:52.521
ignore that dude.

00:09:52.521 --> 00:09:53.354
I throw it out.

00:09:53.354 --> 00:09:54.319
But then there is a fourth one,

00:09:54.319 --> 00:09:56.091
and this where the real growth is.

00:09:56.091 --> 00:09:57.095
Do you know what the fourth one is?

00:09:57.095 --> 00:09:57.928
- I don't.

00:09:57.928 --> 00:09:58.761
- [Neil] The fourth one is,

00:09:58.761 --> 00:09:59.676
you get it.

00:09:59.676 --> 00:10:01.469
You throw it out.

00:10:01.469 --> 00:10:02.344
I'm talking to you,

00:10:02.344 --> 00:10:03.177
and maybe later I'm talking to,

00:10:03.177 --> 00:10:04.315
you know, you.

00:10:04.315 --> 00:10:05.490
I get it.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:06.357
And I'm like,

00:10:06.357 --> 00:10:07.314
nah, it's not true. ,I throw it out.

00:10:07.314 --> 00:10:08.774
And then later I'm
talking to someone else,

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:09.607
I get it.

00:10:09.607 --> 00:10:10.440
It's the third time it's come back to me.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.323
I throw it out, I'm like wait.

00:10:11.323 --> 00:10:12.156
Maybe I got to take thing thing

00:10:12.156 --> 00:10:12.989
a little more seriously.

00:10:12.989 --> 00:10:13.822
- [Host] Right.

00:10:13.822 --> 00:10:14.655
- And it becomes a maybe.

00:10:14.655 --> 00:10:15.501
And then it becomes a yes.

00:10:15.501 --> 00:10:16.773
And that's when the big growth thing is,

00:10:16.773 --> 00:10:17.891
because you kept ignoring this thing

00:10:17.891 --> 00:10:18.932
that was in your face.

00:10:18.932 --> 00:10:20.125
So the best feedback,

00:10:20.125 --> 00:10:21.626
like where you really grow,

00:10:21.626 --> 00:10:23.305
is you keep getting the same feedback.

00:10:23.305 --> 00:10:24.505
You keep dismissing it.

00:10:24.505 --> 00:10:25.338
At some point you say wait.

00:10:25.338 --> 00:10:27.001
Maybe they have something.

00:10:27.001 --> 00:10:29.084
So, one way I do this is.

00:10:30.281 --> 00:10:32.052
I get together a group of people.

00:10:32.052 --> 00:10:33.299
And we sit together once a week.

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:36.545
And talk a lot of stuff
going on in our lives.

00:10:36.545 --> 00:10:38.900
I find group therapy really powerful.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.429
Because if it's just one on one,

00:10:40.429 --> 00:10:41.948
I can just say I disagree with you.

00:10:41.948 --> 00:10:43.319
But when four or five people are saying,

00:10:43.319 --> 00:10:45.091
hey dude, no your really
coming off like that.

00:10:45.091 --> 00:10:47.509
Or your really having this
problem in your relationship.

00:10:47.509 --> 00:10:48.839
Then maybe you need to look at it.

00:10:48.839 --> 00:10:50.393
And five people are saying it.

00:10:50.393 --> 00:10:52.238
Like it's pretty hard to dismiss it.

00:10:52.238 --> 00:10:53.583
- In hip hop it's like, yo he's gay as

00:10:53.583 --> 00:10:54.416
(censored)

00:10:54.416 --> 00:10:55.265
dog, like

00:10:55.265 --> 00:10:56.098
(censored)

00:10:56.098 --> 00:10:56.931
that dude.

00:10:56.931 --> 00:10:57.764
Like you know what I mean.

00:10:57.764 --> 00:10:58.603
Like I just ... Why don't you like him?

00:10:58.603 --> 00:10:59.436
You know what,

00:10:59.436 --> 00:11:00.269
he can rap.

00:11:00.269 --> 00:11:01.102
He got a good story.

00:11:01.102 --> 00:11:01.935
His flows are cool.

00:11:01.935 --> 00:11:02.768
For sure.

00:11:02.768 --> 00:11:03.912
I just don't like him though.

00:11:03.912 --> 00:11:05.989
Like and it's so ignorant,

00:11:05.989 --> 00:11:06.822
it's crazy.

00:11:06.822 --> 00:11:07.655
So, like yeah,

00:11:07.655 --> 00:11:08.488
years ago,

00:11:08.488 --> 00:11:09.321
you know what I'm saying.

00:11:09.321 --> 00:11:10.289
When I first got on blogs,

00:11:10.289 --> 00:11:11.227
and I'd be excited.

00:11:11.227 --> 00:11:12.060
I'd read comments.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.158
But now it's just like,

00:11:13.158 --> 00:11:15.138
there's no point to read comments.

00:11:15.138 --> 00:11:16.157
- Yeah, don't read the comments.

00:11:16.157 --> 00:11:17.569
- Yeah, it's honestly.

00:11:17.569 --> 00:11:18.402
Yeah.

00:11:18.402 --> 00:11:19.640
It's either too positive.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:21.401
Which can lead you to like be big headed.

00:11:21.401 --> 00:11:22.631
Or it's too negative,

00:11:22.631 --> 00:11:24.156
which can make you try to

00:11:24.156 --> 00:11:27.047
create music to get them to stop

00:11:27.047 --> 00:11:28.238
hating on you.

00:11:28.238 --> 00:11:29.091
It's like somebody being like,

00:11:29.091 --> 00:11:29.963
yeah, he should rap like this,

00:11:29.963 --> 00:11:30.796
he should rap like that.

00:11:30.796 --> 00:11:31.629
I don't like the way he raps.

00:11:31.629 --> 00:11:33.455
And then the person
changes up how they rap.

00:11:33.455 --> 00:11:34.421
To try to, you know,

00:11:34.421 --> 00:11:35.959
make that person like them.

00:11:35.959 --> 00:11:36.939
And then they're like,

00:11:36.939 --> 00:11:38.061
man he ain't even being himself.

00:11:38.061 --> 00:11:39.136
Like after you change ...

00:11:39.136 --> 00:11:39.969
(host laughs)

00:11:39.969 --> 00:11:40.802
So it's like you can't win man.

00:11:40.802 --> 00:11:41.635
- Right.

00:11:41.635 --> 00:11:42.468
- You can't win no matter what you do.

00:11:42.468 --> 00:11:43.307
- Right, for sure.

00:11:43.307 --> 00:11:44.720
- [Logic] So for me, I
don't listen to the hate.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.269
I don't listen to love too much.

00:11:46.269 --> 00:11:47.204
I just, you know.

00:11:47.204 --> 00:11:48.037
Take it all in stride.

00:11:48.037 --> 00:11:48.919
Like I love what I do.

00:11:48.919 --> 00:11:50.915
And as long as I can wake
up everyday and feel that,

00:11:50.915 --> 00:11:52.415
I feel like I'm doing right.

00:11:52.415 --> 00:11:54.661
- [Interviewer] Do you read
criticism, of yourself?

00:11:54.661 --> 00:11:55.494
- No.

00:11:55.494 --> 00:11:56.327
I use to.

00:11:56.327 --> 00:11:57.893
I use to, and then I realized,

00:11:57.893 --> 00:11:59.362
it wasn't helpful.

00:11:59.362 --> 00:12:00.988
- [Interviewer] Positive or negative?

00:12:00.988 --> 00:12:01.821
- Mmhmm

00:12:01.821 --> 00:12:02.790
- [Interviewer] It's just a distraction?

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.037
- Yeah I can't,

00:12:04.037 --> 00:12:05.476
I don't look at anything anymore

00:12:05.476 --> 00:12:07.743
that's written, whether
it's like interviews,

00:12:07.743 --> 00:12:08.576
or I mean ...

00:12:08.576 --> 00:12:09.409
(Interviewer laughs)

00:12:09.409 --> 00:12:10.242
It's just,

00:12:10.242 --> 00:12:11.803
it's also just too much focus on yourself.

00:12:11.803 --> 00:12:12.738
- [Interviewer] Mmhmm

00:12:12.738 --> 00:12:13.738
- It's like,

00:12:14.999 --> 00:12:17.082
I am far from the center of the world

00:12:17.082 --> 00:12:18.755
and I don't need to like,

00:12:18.755 --> 00:12:20.187
I need to read about other things

00:12:20.187 --> 00:12:21.020
(Natalie laughs)

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:22.697
There is a lot of really
good things to read

00:12:22.697 --> 00:12:23.530
about and,

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:24.902
I know about myself and,

00:12:24.902 --> 00:12:26.759
if someone makes a mistake about me

00:12:26.759 --> 00:12:28.036
I'm just going to get upset so ...

00:12:28.036 --> 00:12:28.869
- [Interviewer] Mmhmm

00:12:28.869 --> 00:12:31.295
- Or if they say something
negative I'm going to get upset

00:12:31.295 --> 00:12:33.453
And if they say something nice.

00:12:33.453 --> 00:12:35.109
That's friendly but I also don't need

00:12:35.109 --> 00:12:35.942
to care.

00:12:35.942 --> 00:12:38.249
Like I don't need to
base my sense of self on

00:12:38.249 --> 00:12:40.172
what strangers opinions of me are,

00:12:40.172 --> 00:12:41.005
like,

00:12:41.005 --> 00:12:41.961
it's important to me that my friends,

00:12:41.961 --> 00:12:43.536
my family,

00:12:43.536 --> 00:12:47.203
you know, think that
I'm behaving correctly.

00:12:49.284 --> 00:12:50.117
And, they will let me know

00:12:50.117 --> 00:12:51.503
If I'm out of line and,

00:12:51.503 --> 00:12:53.714
and everyone else's opinions like,

00:12:53.714 --> 00:12:54.781
You know.

00:12:54.781 --> 00:12:56.531
It's not my business.

